title: Heygirl
position: 167,234
---
Keira Hudson: Hey girl! I’m in town today, wanna get brunch?
-> Why are you in town?
Keira Hudson: Can't you act more excited? My client wants to look at some apartments in our old neighborhood. For some reason.
-> Our old neighborhood?
Keira Hudson: Yeah, Durville. Where we lived with Mom and Barto until I graduated high school? Well, I guess you wouldn’t remember. How old were you then? Two? Three?
-> Two.
KEIRA HUDSON: Yeah, okay. Anyways, wanna get brunch or no?
->  I’m working, Keira.
KEIRA HUDSON: Ohhhhhhh, good point. I didn’t think about that.
->  Okay, I have to go.
KEIRA HUDSON: Okay byeeeee!!!!

-> put the phone down.
